## Summary {#summary}

Revolut Business is pulling away from the other SME card issuers. Its card revenue rose from £120m in 2021 to £520m in 2025, and its lead over Tide widened from £80m to £320m in the same period.

No issuer pairs a high limit with fast approval. Capital on Tap offers £100k but takes 2 days, and Revolut Business approves in minutes but at £50k. Tide approves the same day at only £10k. Finbridge can own the space between them.

