---
title: Card controls PRD
subtitle: Finbridge: admin limits, merchant blocks and decline reasons
---

## Goal {#goal}

Admins at Finbridge control how each card can be spent. This PRD covers three things engineers build from: a monthly limit per card, blocks on merchant categories, and a decline reason the cardholder sees on the phone. Requirements are ranked Must, Should and Could. The flow runs from setup to the moment a raised limit is approved.

## Requirements {#requirements}

Must-haves come first. Status shows what is already built and what is still open, so engineering can see what to start and what to wait for.

